1: Which Claims hosts are database servers?

fetch dt.entity.host
| fields id, tags
| expand tag = tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:") or startsWith(tag, "DB_C:")
| summarize apmids = arrayRemoveNulls(collectDistinct(if(startsWith(tag, "APMID:"), splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]))),
            dbTypes = arrayRemoveNulls(collectDistinct(if(startsWith(tag, "DB_C:"), tag))),
            by:{id}
| filter arraySize(dbTypes) > 0
| expand apmid = apmids
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize dbHosts = countDistinctExact(id), by:{apmid, dbTypes}
| sort dbHosts desc


This shows which Claims apps sit on DB-tagged hosts, and which database type each one uses.

